      "proof_feedback": null,
      "html": "<div id=\"step-q70828\" class=\"step questionWidget\" style=\"display: block;\"><div class=\"questionWidget-header\"><div class=\"questionWidget-title\">Question 9</div><div class=\"questionWidget-helpButton\">?</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-text\"><p>A nonzero vector <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"164\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c27E8\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.222em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mstyle space=\"2\" style=\"background-color: gainsboro;\"><mjx-mpadded><mjx-block style=\"width: 0.829em; margin: 0.2em 0px; position: relative;\"><mjx-rbox style=\"left: 0.2em; top: 0px; max-width: 0.829em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D44F TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-rbox></mjx-block></mjx-mpadded></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mstyle space=\"2\" style=\"background-color: gainsboro;\"><mjx-mpadded><mjx-block style=\"width: 0.833em; margin: 0.2em 0px; position: relative;\"><mjx-rbox style=\"left: 0.2em; top: 0px; max-width: 0.833em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D450 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-rbox></mjx-block></mjx-mpadded></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c27E9\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace></mstyle><mstyle mathbackground=\"Gainsboro\"><mpadded height=\"+2pt\" depth=\"+2pt\" lspace=\"2pt\" width=\"+4pt\"><mi>b</mi></mpadded></mstyle><mo>,</mo><mstyle mat