wspacing=\"0.6em 0.6em 0.6em 0.3em\"><mtr><mtd><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">v</mi></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">n</mi></mrow></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Hence, we obtain \n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"200\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D42F TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c27E8\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx