    "q-127944": {
      "dom_id": "step-q127944",
      "name": "Question 13",
      "problem": "Find an equation of the plane that passes through the point $Q(-1,1,2)$ and is perpendicular to the line \n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x=5-3t \\\\ y=2+4t \\\\ z=-3+t.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "worked_solution": "Note that the position vector of $Q$ is $q=⟨-1,1,2⟩.$ Converting the parametric equations of the line to vector form, we get\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x=5-3t \\\\ y=2+4t \\\\ z=-3+t\\end{aligned}\\,⟹\\,⟨x,y,z⟩=⟨5,2,-3⟩+t\\text{ }{{⟨-3,4,1⟩}_{⏟}}_{v}.\n$$\n\n \n\nThe direction vector of the line is $v=⟨-3,4,1⟩,$ so a normal vector to the plane is \n\n$$\nn=v=⟨-3,4,1⟩.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation of the plane is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(r-q)\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ r\\cdot n-q\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ r\\cdot n & =q\\cdot n \\\\ r\\cdot ⟨-3,4,1⟩ & =⟨-1,1,2⟩\\cdot ⟨-3,4,1⟩ \\\\ r\\cdot ⟨-3,4,1⟩ & =9.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-127944-a",
              "type": "math",
              "value": "r\\cdot ⟨1,-4,3⟩=15",
              "html": "<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"240\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D42B TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c22C5\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c27E8\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c27E9\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">r</mi></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>"
            },
            {
              "option": "b",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-127944-b",
